<title>USA: Marston beers being introduced in U.S.</title>
<headline>Marston beers being introduced in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident Group Ltd said it is introducing Marston, Thompson &amp; Evershed Plc of Britain's beers and ales in 10 U.S. markets.</p>
<p>The distribution firm said Marston's Pedigree Bitters, India Pale Ale, Albion Porter and Oyster Stout will initially be marketed in New York City; Boston; Hartford and New Haven, Conn.; Providence, R.I.; Baltimore; Washington D.C.; Virginia; Delaware; and New Jersey.</p>
</text>
